  "description": "TARGETED REPAIR of the 342 production rows that are hierarchy-inconsistent with a TRUSTWORTHY ancestor. Same cascade as production-cascade (gemma samples 5 at temp 0.7, disagreement escalates blind to Qwen 3.8-Max) over the subset emitted by build-ancestor-context, with that ancestor's established Korean injected into the prompt. Context is injected at the SAMPLE node, not the escalation node, because escalation replays the sampled prompt verbatim — so both arms see it and routing is not confounded with conditioning. Warranted by a matched A/B on SME gold (run c6c3d40d310b vs b22048d53b05): +10.7 chrF on the 16 context-receiving concepts against +0.0 on the 184 identical-prompt controls, difference-in-differences p<0.0001. Exact match did not move (4/16 -> 5/16) and is far too underpowered at n=16 to; the gain is in phrase structure and term choice. 3 of 16 got worse, so this run is a CANDIDATE set for diffing, not an in-place overwrite.",
